# Implementation Plan - Make Wishlist / Favorites Button Functional

Make the wishlist (favorites) functionality fully functional across the app by introducing a global React Context (`FavoritesContext`) that persists favorite colleges to `localStorage` and keeps the UI synchronized. Create a premium, visually stunning Favorites Page with micro-animations, details, and action buttons.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The favorites will be persisted using `localStorage` so they survive page reloads.
> The initial state of favorites will contain "Patna Science College" and "Nalanda Medical College" (IDs `1` and `3`) to align with the pre-configured mock data in the student dashboard, so there is immediate interactive content.

## Proposed Changes

We will introduce a central state management system for favorites and integrate it across all pages that display college cards or toggle favorites.

