## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Launch development server: `npm run dev`.
2. Browse to the home page, verify featured colleges heart buttons toggle correctly with toast notifications.
3. Browse to the College Listing page `/colleges`, click a heart button to add a college, and verify the count badge on the Navbar increases instantly.
4. Go to `/student/dashboard`, verify the number of saved colleges matches the number in the context. Remove a saved college from the dashboard list, and verify it updates in the Navbar as well.
5. Browse to `/favorites`, verify the shortlisted colleges are listed beautifully with high-quality styled cards. Click "View Details" to ensure it routes to the correct page. Click "Remove" and verify the card disappears with a smooth update.
6. Verify the empty state shows up if all favorites are removed.
